{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkveEcGSkvjT1YvX1UyW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with Harel (הראל), the track called \"כספי (שקלי)\". But I'm not sure, and I won't sign anything until I've talked it over with you, or at least with the bank.\n\n**Why that one:**\n- **The company.** Harel is the only name on the page I know. The others, מור, אנליסט and מיטב, I've never heard of, or only barely. I'm not giving my money to strangers. None of the big banks I know was on the screens I read.\n- **No shares.** Next to that line it says \"מניות 0%\" and \"מט\"ח 0%\". So, as I understand it, the money isn't in shares and isn't in dollars. That's the closest thing on the page to my deposits.\n- **What it earned.** It shows \"4.25%\" for 3 years and \"3.08%\" for 5 years. The column heading says \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת\", so I think that's per year. That's not more than some of the deposits I've had, so I'm not convinced it's worth moving.\n- **The fee.** The fee is \"0.57%\" from the savings. I can't tell whether that's a lot.\n- **The name.** I don't really know what \"כספי\" means. I'm guessing it's money kept in shekels.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n1. The heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\".\n2. The product buttons. \"קופת גמל להשקעה\" was already selected.\n3. A row of buttons with tracks. Some had English letters I'd have to read out one by one: \"S&P 500\".\n4. A big table, company after company, one line per track: Harel, then מור, אנליסט, and the start of מיטב. In each line I looked for the word אג\"ח and for 0% next to מניות.\n5. I stopped after six screens of the fifteen. Too many numbers, and I was tired.\n\n**What I skipped**\n- The little circles. I don't know what they mean.\n- The \"?\" marks.\n- The link \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\". I should probably have opened it.\n- The column \"כסף מנוהל\" with all the millions and billions.\n- The \"עוקב מדד\" lines. To me מדד is the price index on the news, so I didn't understand them.\n\n**What I didn't understand**\n- Words: \"עוקב מדד\", \"S&P 500\", \"גמיש\", \"כספי (שקלי)\". I'm not sure \"מט\"ח\" means dollars and foreign money.\n- \"מניות 101%\". How can it be more than a hundred?\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" where a number should be.\n- An orange mark with \"עוד לא דווח\".\n- \"הפקדה 0%\" next to \"חיסכון 0.57%\". Two different fees?\n\n**What bothered me**\n- The whole page is black with grey writing. Even enlarged, the column headings and the small labels were hard to read.\n- Every line has six or seven numbers. It made me anxious.\n- The track I would have gone to first, \"אג\"ח ממשלות\" at מיטב, says \"עוד לא דווח\" with an orange mark. So I backed away from it.\n- Many of Harel's tracks have shares in them, \"עד 25% מניות\". I don't want that."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2141,"cache_read_input_tokens":13489,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2141},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"990119c1-a5e1-442e-8230-828cb5c1f400","uuid":"9cca4362-a3d8-4939-8e5f-68af3fe3499c","timestamp":"2026-11-06T02:59:10.293Z","request_id":"req_011CgkveEBxg43J1yTYmXBLs"}
